sexist.  It's comments like yours that diminish *real* sexism.  I'm sorry to
be harsh, especially in my first reply to anything in this mailing list, but
you find fault where there is no fault and that is wrong.

Men carry pianos and women kiss men, women also carry pianos just as men
also kiss women.  Women also kiss women and men also kiss men.  We don't
need to point all of these examples out just to make everyone feel all warm
and fuzzy inside; thinking we need to do so is what I find demeaning.

